{"product_id":"peppa-pig-the-amazing-collection-1-50","title":"Peppa Pig: The Amazing Collection 1–50","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"397\"\u003ePeppa Pig: The Amazing Collection 1–50  is a delightful paperback box set featuring 50 engaging storybooks centered around Peppa Pig and her adventures. This collection is designed to captivate young readers, offering a vibrant and educational experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"850\"\u003eThe set includes 50 individual storybooks, each filled with colorful illustrations and simple narratives that are perfect for early readers. Some of the titles in the collection include School Play, George's Hiccups, The Picnic, Surprises, Dressing Up, Flying a Kite, Muddy Car, School Camp, Daddy Pig's Birthday, and The Rainy Day. These stories explore everyday scenarios and imaginative adventures, making them relatable and enjoyable for children.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45802506682521,"sku":"10RA09876543","price":150.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/81MsOLYt48L._UF1000_1000_QL80.jpg?v=1760713513","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/peppa-pig-the-amazing-collection-1-50","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}